cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fpcalib: calibration of a Bayesian false-positive occupancy model under detection heterogeneity"
abstract: >-
  Simulation-based calibration of a Bayesian false-positive (misclassification)
  single-season occupancy model fit in Stan, with a head-to-head comparison
  against the frequentist occuFP estimator from unmarked.
type: software
version: 0.0.0.9000
license: GPL-3.0
authors:
